## [2.1.20260711190235] - 2026-07-11 19:02:35

### ADD

- Added **TCP_CONCURRENT_DIAL** environment variable to customize **TCP concurrent dialing count**; once set, no longer automatically downgrades to single-route on China Mobile networks.
- Added **PROXY_CONCURRENT_DIAL** environment variable to customize **reverse proxy concurrent dialing count**.

## [2.1.20260711022318] - 2026-07-11 02:23:18

### Change

- Optimized **reverse proxy logic**: Fixed issue where multiple reverse proxy node parameters were overwritten by global variables and failed to take effect.
- Optimized **DoH caching**: Cached recent domain resolution results to reduce redundant requests, improve lookup speed, and reduce resource usage; domains with no results are also temporarily cached to avoid repeated queries.

### ADD

- Added **reverse proxy concurrent dialing count**: Allows adjusting concurrent reverse proxy connections. Higher count speeds up connection but rotates IPs more frequently; lower count provides greater connection stability.
- Added **subscription conversion configuration**: More feature options including **UDP**, **XUDP**, **TLS 1.3**, **node type injection**, and **basic node sorting**, passed through to subscription conversion backend.
- Added **Trojan Fallback proxy**: Trojan protocol now supports setting a backup proxy address. Automatically switches to backup proxy when primary connection fails, improving stability and reliability. [PR #1359](https://github.com/cmliu/edgetunnel/pull/1359)

