## [2.1.20260518183745] - 2026-05-18 18:37:45

### ADD

- Added **PRELOAD_RACE_DIAL** environment variable for custom **TCP preload race dialing**: Concurrently queries A/AAAA records via DoH on first direct domain connection, prioritizing IPv4 and supplementing with IPv6 up to `TCP_CONCURRENT_DIAL` limit; separated from reverse proxy fallback to avoid false triggers.

## [2.1.20260517185203] - 2026-05-17 18:52:03

### Debug

- Fixed **WS/XHTTP/gRPC upload**: Upstream writing waits for remote write completion before processing subsequent chunks, preventing rapid build-up and `upload queue overflow` during bursts.
- Optimized **WS explicit transmission queue**: Upstream queue protection adjusted from 256KB to 16MB / 4096 entries; properly releases pending write tasks upon cleanup to reduce overflow during large file uploads.

## [2.1.20260515185129] - 2026-05-15 18:51:29

### Change

- Optimized **Shadowsocks subscription**: When TLS is disabled, automatically rewrites preferred ports to noTLS ports (not applicable to reverse proxy IPs).
- Optimized **GO2SOCKS5** variable: Changed from overwrite mode to append mode. [PR #1202](https://github.com/cmliu/edgetunnel/pull/1202)

## [2.1.20260513042803] - 2026-05-13 04:28:03

### Change

- Optimized **VLESS** hot path: UUID pre-decoded to 16 bytes for direct comparison; initial packet parsing uses offset and `subarray()` to reduce copying. [Reference](https://github.com/ToiCF/GrainTCP)
- Optimized **WS Early Data**: Added 8KB upper limit protection and prevented standard WebSocket subprotocols from being mistakenly treated as early data. [Reference](https://github.com/ToiCF/GrainTCP)
- Optimized **WS/XHTTP/gRPC** upstream pipeline: Added bounded queue, small packet merging, and 256KB backpressure protection to reduce frequent small writes and prevent unbounded queue growth. [Reference](https://github.com/ToiCF/GrainTCP)
- Optimized downstream **GrainTCP** sending: Aggregates small packets using microtasks and brief quiet windows; large packets flush aggregator in BYOB path then send directly, reducing copies and WebSocket frame counts. [Reference](https://github.com/ToiCF/GrainTCP)
- Optimized TCP connection establishment: Direct connections and proxyip candidates use 4-way concurrent dialing racing for first successful connection; SOCKS/HTTP/HTTPS/TURN/SSTP proxy paths maintain original handshake logic. [Reference](https://github.com/ToiCF/GrainTCP)
- Optimized WebSocket handshake and WS pipeline: Added fallback for `allowHalfOpen` exceptions, emptied `Sec-WebSocket-Extensions` on 101 response, and used explicit sequential queue for WS main pipeline. [Reference](https://github.com/ToiCF/GrainTCP)

